<title>UK: Citibank sets call warrants on UAP.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets call warrants on UAP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued two million call warrants, in two equal tranches, on UAP stock, lead manager Citibank SA said.</p>
<p> PAYDATE	21.OCT.96</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> LISTING	PARIS</p>
<p> SPOT REF     102.50</p>
<p> WARRANTS  STRIKE   ISS PRICE    PREMIUM    GEARING    MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A    100.0    18.80 FRF    15.90 PCT  5.5 TIMES  17.DEC.97</p>
<p> CALL B    120.0    26.50 FRF    42.93 PCT  3.9 TIMES  17.DEC.99</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  CTPA</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
